      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹8.00 (vs ₹4.20 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.00 (up from ₹4.20 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.54b (up 60% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹105.4m (up 90% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.8% (up from 5.7% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 35% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 24% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
