      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.71 (up from ₹1.72 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹386.9m (up 46% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹35.7m (up 58% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.2% (up from 8.6% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 26% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 17% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
