      "title": "Bansal Roofing Products Limited Announces Board and Committee Changes",
      "body": "Bansal Roofing Products Limited appointed Ms. Nishi Brahmkhatri as an Additional Director with effect from January 24, 2026.Ms. Nishi Brahmkhatri, aged 26 years, is a qualified Chartered Accountant (CA) with extensive experience in Direct tax, Auditing & Assurance. She holds a Chartered Accountant qualification and a Bachelors of Commerce degree. Ms. Brahmkhatri has experience in filing more than 500 Income Tax Returns, 1,000+ TDS returns, and involvement in 30+ tax audits, handling assessment and litigation matters under Direct Tax laws, leading TDS compliance and handling forms such as 15CA, 15CB, 10A, 10B, and 10BB. She has assisted and led statutory audits, including audit planning, risk assessment, testing, and report drafting, and conducted audits across industries such as Pharmaceut",
